stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Prospective: explicit purpose
    Prospective --> Verified: verify required links
    Prospective --> Restricted: purpose withdrawn
    Verified --> Active: relationship begins
    Active --> Active: preferences and roles change
    Active --> Disputed: correction requested
    Disputed --> Active: correction approved
    Disputed --> Restricted: use limited
    Active --> Dormant: no current relationship
    Dormant --> Active: relationship resumes
    Active --> Former: relationship ends
    Dormant --> Former: retention transition
    Former --> Restricted: legal hold or rights review
    Restricted --> Former: restriction resolved
    Former --> Deleted: retention expires
    Restricted --> Deleted: deletion approved
    Deleted --> [*]

